<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Box fighting</Major>
    <Description>this macro for fortnite makes it so you can take other people's walls and replace it with one of your ones. if you are doing box pvp this will be extremely useful. Just get the wall to 1 hit then press the key and it will mine it and replace it</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 299 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 15 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 1 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>